php-abraflexi-datatables (1.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix PHP 8.4 fatals: preTableCode/tableCode/postTableCode/columnDefs must
    return string (they are concatenated into DataTable JS)
  * Use Debian libjs-jquery-datatables assets under /javascript/jquery-datatables/
  * Treat AbraFlexi\RO::$filter as string in dataSourceURI (not array_merge)
  * Fix prepareColumns to reset per-column state and map known AbraFlexi types
  * Default dom without Buttons plugin (not shipped by Debian package)
  * Czech language via DataTables CDN i18n; depend on libjs-jquery-datatables

